window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A USA TODAY bestseller.</p> <p>From New York Times bestselling author Penelope Ward comes an epic standalone, friends-to-lovers story…with a jaw-dropping twist you won't see coming.</p> <p>Skylar has been my best friend since childhood, but I secretly pine for her. One thing after another has kept us apart, and I’ve spent the last decade in fear of losing her forever.</p> <p>Because of me, she left town. For years, I thought I’d never see her again.</p> <p>But now she’s back…and living with him.</p> <p>I don’t deserve her after everything I’ve put her through, but I can’t live without her. This is my last chance, because she’s about to make the biggest mistake of her life. I can see it her eyes: she doesn’t love the man she’s set to marry. She still loves me...which is why I have to stop her before it’s too late.</p> <p>A STANDALONE novel.</p> <p>Standalone Books in the Jake Series:</p> <p>Jake Undone (Jake #1)</p> <p>My Skylar (Jake #2)</p> <p>Jake Understood (Jake #3)</p>"; 
